# Contributing to ${name}

Thanks for considering a contribution.

## Reporting issues

Please file issues at the project's tracker. Include:
- What you tried, what happened, what you expected.
- The version of `${name}` you're running.
- Reproduction steps if applicable.

## Pull requests

- Fork the repo and create a topic branch (`feature/<short-name>`).
- Run the test suite locally before opening a PR.
- Follow [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/) for commit messages.
- Sign off on each commit (`git commit -s`) — this project follows the [DCO](https://developercertificate.org/).

## Code of Conduct

By participating you agree to abide by the [Code of Conduct](./CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md).
